{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46146","headline":"怀邻叟 · 贯休","name":"怀邻叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常思东溪[庞]眉翁，是非不解两颊红。\n桔橰打水声嘎嘎，紫芋白薤肥蒙蒙。\n鸥鸭静游深竹里，儿孙多在好花中。\n千门万户皆车马，谁爱如斯太古风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46146.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46146","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}